OL,5,G2000 Griff's Canadian Adventure
OL,6,     FGriff Rhys Jones explores the
OL,7,     Fprairies and vast plains of
OL,8,     FSaskatchewan and Alberta, where he
OL,9,     Fdiscovers a diversity of riches,
OL,10,     Ffrom dinosaur fossils to acres of
OL,11,     Fcultivated farmland. (Ep5/6)
