OL,5,G2340 24 Hours in A&E
OL,6,     FTania, who's 40, is in resus after
OL,7,     Fbeing knocked over by a car.
OL,8,     FEdwin, who's 77, is rushed to A&E
OL,9,     Fbleeding from a tumour. And
OL,10,     Ffootballer Lilli has damaged her
OL,11,     Feye socket.
OL,12,G0040 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FXintong, who's 28, has been flung
OL,14,     Ffrom a go-kart at speed. Doctors
OL,15,     Fare concerned there may be damage
OL,16,     Fto her spine. Gary, who's 58, has
OL,17,     Ftrapped his finger in two shopping
OL,18,     Ftrolleys.
